<title>UK: LIFFE to launch Bobl futures, options in Sept/Oct.</title>
<headline>LIFFE to launch Bobl futures, options in Sept/Oct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London International Financial Futures and Options Exchange (LIFFE) said on Wednesday it would launch medium-term German government bond (Bobl) futures and options contracts in September/October 1997.</p>
<p>LIFFE said the launch was part of its strategy for Economic and Monetary Union (EMU).  </p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 6784</p>
